gods\n\ud83d\udc67 Guide your villagers\n\ud83d\udcdc Complete story quests\n\u2753 And more revealed soon\u2026\n\nWhat Kind of God Will You Be?", "short_description": "How to God is a God Simulation game that grants you the freedom to shape your villages, choose your alignment, and mold the world in ways only a true god could imagine. How to God combines creative, open sandbox elements with all the classic features from your favorite God Simulation games. Coming soon to Meta Quest 2, 3, and 3S."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thoughtfish.de/htg-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thoughtfish.de/htg-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Thoughtfish GmbH", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.thoughtfish.de/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB", "de", "de_CH", "fr_BE", "fr_CA", "fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9482929661726991"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1216935843969370"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "25048857934742999"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1551077269214189"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "789601640385453"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "23969529562705662"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "980141234053248"}]}, "baseline_o